D1. Early American lighter that worked. ~ REVERE
D2. Something that keeps a ballplayer awake nights. ~ AVERAGE
D3. Symbol of power. ~ FE
D4. Preposition. ~ FROM
D5. In Rome these were equivalent to the radio, the waffle iron and the washing machine. ~ LARES
